For our Houston location we are looking for the best C# Software developer in town. Currently we are looking to grow our Software team in Houston. If you are a highly motivated professional with the talent we seek, now is the time to join Data2save.
At Data2save a Software Developer Is Responsible For
Working in a team of software specialist;
Creating software modules for our Agility software line;
Following the Data2save Programming Style Guide;
Testing, Documenting and Implementing new Agility Modules;
The Following We Ask
Bachelor's degree, or related work experience;
2-5 years Software development experience;
Good understanding of Visual Studio, C#, MS SQL Server, Azure
Only those candidates meeting the above requirements will be contacted. No relocation or visa sponsorship is planned for this position. Data2save offers a competitive compensation package.
As part of our pre-employment process, we require that applicants agree to submit to drug and background screenings. We will contact only those who are a potential match.
Please send your Resume with cover letter to: HR@data2save.com
